# Shared capture settings — sourced by every view tape so the seven images stay
# one consistent set. Edit here, then re-render ALL of them; never edit a single
# tape's geometry.
#
# FontSize 13 is the largest that still fits the widest status bar (the
# Attributes tab adds "s sort / f filter"); at 14 the trailing
# "refresh every 30s" is clipped.
# Framerate 5 only thins the throwaway GIF — Screenshot quality is unaffected.
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Framerate 5
